WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:04.244
Before a protein takes shape, transfer RNA helps turn

00:00:04.244 --> 00:00:07.936
genetic instructions into an amino-acid sequence. It

00:00:07.936 --> 00:00:08.078
is

00:00:08.078 --> 00:00:10.169
not passive cellular plumbing.

00:00:14.383 --> 00:00:18.124
tRNA charging, chemical modification, cleavage and

00:00:18.124 --> 00:00:21.715
localisation create several different biological

00:00:21.715 --> 00:00:24.931
functions and possible intervention points.

00:00:29.425 --> 00:00:33.188
Aminoacyl-tRNA synthetases have catalytic charging

00:00:33.188 --> 00:00:37.102
functions, and some have additional signalling roles

00:00:37.102 --> 00:00:38.532
beyond translation.

00:00:42.550 --> 00:00:46.203
Disrupting universally needed translation can injure

00:00:46.203 --> 00:00:49.716
healthy cells. A drug programme must demonstrate a

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:51.893
disease-specific vulnerability.

00:00:56.008 --> 00:00:59.999
An enzyme pocket, disease-associated RNA fragment or

00:00:59.999 --> 00:01:03.836
extracellular synthetase domain requires different

00:01:03.836 --> 00:01:06.215
chemistry, assays and delivery.

00:01:10.592 --> 00:01:14.230
The column argues for testing the exact molecular

00:01:14.230 --> 00:01:17.860
dependency rather than declaring the entire tRNA

00:01:17.860 --> 00:01:18.314
system

00:01:18.314 --> 00:01:20.319
either undruggable or safe.
